     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This story will be considered complete when a BasicContainer resource can be deleted.  When a subsequent GET is called on the resource it should return a 404. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "An fcr:tombstone should exist under the deleted resource path - ie deleted_resource/fcr:tombstone.   ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
